# Grafana 알림 프로비저닝 (Terraform modules/monitoring이 생성, UI에서 수정할 수 없다)
#   - 연락처 : Discord #incident(즉시 대응) / #alerts(확인 필요). 웹훅 URL은 .env(SSM)에서 $변수로 주입
#   - 라우팅 : stage=prod 이고 severity=page → #incident, 나머지 → #alerts
#   - 규칙   : 대상 스테이지 ${stage_regex} 의 서비스 지표 (로그 수집 유실은 CloudWatch 알람 <stage>-alloy-log-dropped)
#   규칙을 파일에서 지우면 Grafana에 남는다. 지울 때는 deleteRules에 uid를 한 번 넣어 배포한다.
apiVersion: 1

contactPoints:
  - orgId: 1
    name: discord-incident
    receivers:
      - uid: discord-incident
        type: discord
        settings:
          url: $DISCORD_WEBHOOK_INCIDENT
          use_discord_username: false
  - orgId: 1
    name: discord-alerts
    receivers:
      - uid: discord-alerts
        type: discord
        settings:
          url: $DISCORD_WEBHOOK_ALERTS
          use_discord_username: false

policies:
  - orgId: 1
    receiver: discord-alerts
    group_by: ["alertname", "stage", "service"]
    group_wait: 30s
    group_interval: 5m
    repeat_interval: 4h
    routes:
      - receiver: discord-incident
        object_matchers:
          - ["stage", "=", "prod"]
          - ["severity", "=", "page"]
        group_wait: 30s
        group_interval: 5m
        repeat_interval: 1h

groups:
  - orgId: 1
    name: services
    folder: Moyeota V2 Alerts
    interval: 1m
    rules:
      # 수집 대상(태스크)이 메트릭에 응답하지 않음
      - uid: moyeota-target-down
        title: 수집 대상 응답 없음
        condition: B
        data:
          - refId: A
            relativeTimeRange: { from: 300, to: 0 }
            datasourceUid: prometheus
            model:
              refId: A
              expr: >-
                min by (stage, service, instance) (up{stage=~"${stage_regex}"})
              instant: true
              range: false
          - refId: B
            datasourceUid: __expr__
            model:
              refId: B
              type: threshold
              expression: A
              conditions:
                - evaluator: { type: lt, params: [1] }
        noDataState: OK
        execErrState: Error
        for: 2m
        labels:
          severity: page
        annotations:
          summary: "{{ $labels.stage }} {{ $labels.service }} 태스크 {{ $labels.instance }} 가 메트릭에 응답하지 않음"
          description: 태스크가 비정상 종료됐거나 관리 포트(8090)·/metrics가 응답하지 않는다. ECS 서비스 이벤트와 컨테이너 로그를 확인한다.

      # Spring(rest·websocket) 5xx 비율 > 5% (분당 6건 미만의 저트래픽은 제외)
      - uid: moyeota-spring-5xx-ratio
        title: Spring 5xx 비율 높음
        condition: B
        data:
          - refId: A
            relativeTimeRange: { from: 600, to: 0 }
            datasourceUid: prometheus
            model:
              refId: A
              expr: >-
                (
                  sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{stage=~"${stage_regex}", uri!~"/actuator.*", status=~"5.."}[5m]))
                  / sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{stage=~"${stage_regex}", uri!~"/actuator.*"}[5m]))
                )
                and sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{stage=~"${stage_regex}", uri!~"/actuator.*"}[5m])) > 0.1
              instant: true
              range: false
          - refId: B
            datasourceUid: __expr__
            model:
              refId: B
              type: threshold
              expression: A
              conditions:
                - evaluator: { type: gt, params: [0.05] }
        noDataState: OK
        execErrState: Error
        for: 5m
        labels:
          severity: page
        annotations:
          summary: "{{ $labels.stage }} {{ $labels.service }} 5xx 비율 {{ humanizePercentage $values.A.Value }}"
          description: 최근 5분 5xx 비율이 5%를 넘었다. 'V2 서비스 상세' 대시보드의 URI별 요청량과 에러 로그를 확인한다.

      # FastAPI 5xx 비율 > 5% (prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator 기본 지표)
      - uid: moyeota-fastapi-5xx-ratio
        title: FastAPI 5xx 비율 높음
        condition: B
        data:
          - refId: A
            relativeTimeRange: { from: 600, to: 0 }
            datasourceUid: prometheus
            model:
              refId: A
              expr: >-
                (
                  sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_requests_total{stage=~"${stage_regex}", status="5xx"}[5m]))
                  / sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_requests_total{stage=~"${stage_regex}"}[5m]))
                )
                and sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_requests_total{stage=~"${stage_regex}"}[5m])) > 0.1
              instant: true
              range: false
          - refId: B
            datasourceUid: __expr__
            model:
              refId: B
              type: threshold
              expression: A
              conditions:
                - evaluator: { type: gt, params: [0.05] }
        noDataState: OK
        execErrState: Error
        for: 5m
        labels:
          severity: page
        annotations:
          summary: "{{ $labels.stage }} {{ $labels.service }} 5xx 비율 {{ humanizePercentage $values.A.Value }}"
          description: 최근 5분 FastAPI 5xx 비율이 5%를 넘었다. 외부 API 응답과 fastapi 로그를 확인한다.

      # Spring p99 > 2.5s (10분 지속). 사용자 영향 판단은 SLO burn-rate 알림이 맡고, 이 규칙은 조기 경보
      - uid: moyeota-spring-p99-latency
        title: Spring p99 응답 시간 높음
        condition: B
        data:
          - refId: A
            relativeTimeRange: { from: 600, to: 0 }
            datasourceUid: prometheus
            model:
              refId: A
              expr: >-
                histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (stage, service, le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{stage=~"${stage_regex}", uri!~"/actuator.*"}[5m])))
                and sum by (stage, service) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{stage=~"${stage_regex}", uri!~"/actuator.*"}[5m])) > 0.1
              instant: true
              range: false
          - refId: B
            datasourceUid: __expr__
            model:
              refId: B
              type: threshold
              expression: A
              conditions:
                - evaluator: { type: gt, params: [2.5] }
        noDataState: OK
        execErrState: Error
        for: 10m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: "{{ $labels.stage }} {{ $labels.service }} p99 {{ humanizeDuration $values.A.Value }}"
          description: p99 응답 시간이 10분 동안 2.5초를 넘었다. URI별 p99와 DB 커넥션 대기를 확인한다.

      # DB 커넥션 풀 대기 (HikariCP)
      - uid: moyeota-hikari-pending
        title: DB 커넥션 대기 발생
        condition: B
        data:
          - refId: A
            relativeTimeRange: { from: 300, to: 0 }
            datasourceUid: prometheus
            model:
              refId: A
              expr: >-
                max by (stage, service, instance) (hikaricp_connections_pending{stage=~"${stage_regex}"})
              instant: true
              range: false
          - refId: B
            datasourceUid: __expr__
            model:
              refId: B
              type: threshold
              expression: A
              conditions:
                - evaluator: { type: gt, params: [0] }
        noDataState: OK
        execErrState: Error
        for: 5m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: "{{ $labels.stage }} {{ $labels.service }} {{ $labels.instance }} DB 커넥션 대기 {{ $values.A.Value }}건"
          description: 커넥션 풀이 5분 동안 부족했다. 느린 쿼리, 커넥션 누수, 풀 크기와 DB max_connections를 확인한다.

      # JVM 힙 사용률 > 90% (10분 지속)
      - uid: moyeota-jvm-heap-high
        title: JVM 힙 사용률 높음
        condition: B
        data:
          - refId: A
            relativeTimeRange: { from: 300, to: 0 }
            datasourceUid: prometheus
            model:
              refId: A
              expr: >-
                sum by (stage, service, instance) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{stage=~"${stage_regex}", area="heap"})
                / sum by (stage, service, instance) (jvm_memory_max_bytes{stage=~"${stage_regex}", area="heap"} > 0)
              instant: true
              range: false
          - refId: B
            datasourceUid: __expr__
            model:
              refId: B
              type: threshold
              expression: A
              conditions:
                - evaluator: { type: gt, params: [0.9] }
        noDataState: OK
        execErrState: Error
        for: 10m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: "{{ $labels.stage }} {{ $labels.service }} {{ $labels.instance }} 힙 {{ humanizePercentage $values.A.Value }}"
          description: 힙 사용률이 10분 동안 90%를 넘었다. GC 일시 정지 시간과 OOM 재시작 여부를 확인한다.
